.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "bead resource" 1  "bead resource " 
.SH NAME
bead resource \- Manage workspace\-local resource declarations
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead resource\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Declare local resource keys for atomic claim exclusion.
.PP
Resource locks are scheduling exclusions inside this one native workspace. They
are not distributed locks and do not coordinate different stores.
.PP
  bead resource add <ID> \-\-key <KEY>
  bead resource remove <ID> \-\-key <KEY>
  bead resource list <ID>
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
bead resource\-add(1)
Add one or more normalized local resource keys
.TP
bead resource\-remove(1)
Remove one or more local resource keys
.TP
bead resource\-list(1)
List declared local resource keys
.TP
bead resource\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
